    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Nyanco! In this adventure, you control Nyanco that has a bomb installed in her heart. Now you must find your way out, or just wait for your life to be quiet forever. (\u0e05'\u03c9'\u0e05)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Various comics and anime parodies (/\u2267\u25bd\u2266)/<br></li><li>3 Endings (Bad, Happy, and Another Endings)<br></li><li>The strange tricks filled with interesting twists<br></li><li>Of Nyanco, By Nyanco, For Nyanco.\u30fd(=^\uff65\u03c9\uff65^=)\u4e3f<br></li><li>Recommended for ADV Lovers, Otaku and Live Streamers!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hint</strong></h2>Though some tricks seem to have no clue, you will be able to find a way eventually.\u30fd(=\u00b4\u25bd`=)\uff89<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Special Thanks</strong></h2>Alice, nashix, glow, Endark, Schematist, GoldenCat, ParanoX, Rainbow Uncle, HaZE, and you!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106920/extras/a215689f9d07792f37b9f54eb34800e0.avif?t=1667023966\" /></div>",
